2. Bundled npm packages and Rust crates  --  their own licenses
================================================================================

The web UI bundles npm packages (React, React Router, xterm.js, Lucide and
their dependencies), and the Pi binaries link Rust crates. Each keeps its own
license. web/public/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt lists every one with its license
text, after this NOTICE. tools/third-party-notices.py generates it from
web/package-lock.json and Cargo.lock, and CI fails when it is out of date. The
web UI serves it at /THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt, linked from Settings > System >
Resources.

Files under web/node_modules/ are installed by npm and are not part of this
project's source; build from package.json / package-lock.json instead.

